'''Corrupted Valkyrie''' (反逆のヴァルキリー, ''Hangyaku no Varukirī'', '''Rebellion Valkyrie''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy first seen as the boss of the [[Moon (Into the Future)|Moon]] in [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2. She was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]].

