==Enemy==
This enemy has a fast attack rate, Area Attack and the ability to double her attack power after reaching 40% HP. She also outranges most [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare]] and [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare]] [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]]/[[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Alien Cats]], including [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Shaman Cat]], [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Bishop Cat]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Surfer Cat]] and [[Bodhisattva Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bodhisattva Cat]], but ''not'' [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Psychocat]]. Before fighting her, it is highly recommended to collect <u>'''ALL'''</u> [[anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] up to this point so she can be at a reasonable difficulty level for the average player. When she is encountered in the Heavenly Tower and Infernal Tower, she is not a threat at all due to being at 100% magnification.

