==Trivia==
*The winged headpiece she wears is similar to the ones worn by the Valkyries [[wikia:valkyrieprofile:Lenneth|Lenneth]], [[wikia:valkyrieprofile:Hrist|Hrist]] and [[wikia:valkyrieprofile:Silmeria|Silmeria]] in the [[wikipedia:Valkyrie Profile|''Valkyrie Profile'']] series.
*She is the only enemy to have been nerfed twice: the first time decreased her base HP from 600,000 to 555,555, while the second gave her a slight delay between attacks (she used to attack non-stop).
*The lance's name Woofnir is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Gungnir|Gungnir]] and [[wikipedia:Mjölnir|Mjölnir]].

